abstract: >-
  Decision-support platform for CISOs integrating governance, risk and
  compliance (GRC) with explainable AI. Developed as a Master's project
  (Trabalho de Projeto) in Cybersecurity and Digital Forensics at the
  School of Technology and Management (ESTG), Polytechnic of Leiria,
  Portugal. The thesis-evaluated version is frozen at tag v1.0-thesis.
